*                   balloons through guarded static EXE caves. A bounded   *
*                   GID/balloon table is fed by the EXTN dispatcher ring;  *
*                   no NPC-name DLL, runtime hook, or heap container is    *
*                   required. /shownpcname persistence uses a one-byte     *
*                   savedata file through existing client Win32 imports.   *
